---
import MainLayout from '../../layouts/MainLayout.astro';
import Button from '../../components/Button.astro';
---

<MainLayout
  title="Pyko vs Rattle vs Momentum: AI CRM Automation Compared"
  description="A detailed comparison of Pyko, Rattle, and Momentum for CRM automation. Features, pricing, and AI capabilities compared side by side."
>
  <article class="py-16 md:py-24">
    <div class="container mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
        <div class="mb-8">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
            <span class="text-sm px-3 py-1 rounded-full font-medium" style="background: rgba(156, 39, 176, 0.1); color: #9C27B0;">Comparison</span>
            <span class="text-sm text-gray-500">January 2026</span>
          </div>
          <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold mb-6" style="color: #061A35;">
            Pyko vs Rattle vs Momentum: AI CRM Automation Compared
          </h1>
          <p class="text-xl text-gray-600">
            Looking for a CRM automation tool that bridges Salesforce/HubSpot with Slack/Teams? Here's how the top three options compare.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none" style="color: #374151;">
          <h2 style="color: #061A35;">The CRM Automation Landscape</h2>
          <p>The market for CRM-to-chat automation tools has exploded. Sales teams want real-time deal alerts in Slack, one-click CRM updates, and AI-powered intelligence. Three tools lead the space: Pyko, Rattle, and Momentum.</p>
          <p>Here's an honest comparison to help you decide.</p>

          <h2 style="color: #061A35;">Quick Comparison</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="my-8 overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full border-collapse rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-gray-200 bg-white text-sm">
            <thead>
              <tr class="bg-gray-50">
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-left font-semibold" style="color: #061A35;">Feature</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold" style="color: #F94730;">Pyko</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold text-gray-600">Rattle</th>
                <th class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold text-gray-600">Momentum</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200">
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">Starting price</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center font-semibold" style="color: #F94730;">~$8/user/mo</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center">~$20/user/mo</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center">From $69/user/mo</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">Salesforce</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">HubSpot</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-gray-500">In rollout</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">Slack</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">Microsoft Teams</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-gray-500">Coming soon</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">AI automation suggestions</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">AI weekly digest</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">Smart alert enrichment</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">NL automation builder</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">Data cleaning rules</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">&#10007;</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">One-click CRM actions</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">&#10003;</td></tr>
              <tr><td class="px-4 py-3" style="color: #374151;">Free trial</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">14 days</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center" style="color: #10B981;">14 days</td><td class="px-4 py-3 text-center text-red-500">Demo only</td></tr>
            </tbody>
          </table>
        </div>

        <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none" style="color: #374151;">
          <h2 style="color: #061A35;">Pyko: Best Value for Mid-Market Teams</h2>
          <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Teams of 20-200 reps who need CRM automation without enterprise pricing.</p>
          <p>Pyko stands out with dual CRM support (Salesforce + HubSpot), dual chat support (Slack + Teams), and AI features included in every plan. The natural language automation builder lets anyone create complex automations by describing what they want in plain English.</p>
          <p>Key differentiators:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>AI-powered automation suggestions that analyze your CRM and recommend what to build</li>
            <li>Weekly AI digests sent to every rep's Slack on Monday morning</li>
            <li>Smart alert enrichment that adds context to every notification</li>
            <li>HubSpot + Microsoft Teams support (unique in this category)</li>
            <li>Pricing starts at ~$4/user/month with volume discounts</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 style="color: #061A35;">Rattle: Salesforce-Slack Specialist</h2>
          <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Salesforce + Slack shops that want proven, mature automation.</p>
          <p>Rattle has been in the market longer and has a solid feature set for Salesforce-to-Slack automation. Their bi-directional sync is well-regarded. However, they lack HubSpot and Teams support, and don't offer AI features like smart suggestions or weekly digests.</p>

          <h2 style="color: #061A35;">Momentum: Enterprise AI Revenue Platform</h2>
          <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Enterprise sales teams with large budgets who need call intelligence and deal rooms.</p>
          <p>Momentum is a comprehensive AI revenue orchestration platform with call summarization, deal rooms, and workflow automation. Starting at $69/user/month (Business plan) and $99/user/month (Transformation), it's a larger investment than pure CRM automation tools. Enterprise pricing is custom-quoted. Momentum offers a 50% startup discount for teams under 10.</p>

          <h2 style="color: #061A35;">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p>If you're a mid-market team looking for the best value in AI CRM automation:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Choose Pyko</strong> if you want AI intelligence, dual CRM/chat support, and aggressive pricing</li>
            <li><strong>Choose Rattle</strong> if you're a pure Salesforce + Slack shop and want a mature, proven tool</li>
            <li><strong>Choose Momentum</strong> if you're an enterprise team with budget for a comprehensive revenue platform</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 p-8 rounded-2xl" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #071935 0%, #0A2342 100%);">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-3">Try Pyko free for 14 days</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-300 mb-6">See how AI-powered CRM automation works for your team.</p>
          <Button href="/trial" variant="primary" size="lg">Start Free Trial</Button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </article>
</MainLayout>